cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NeuroSignal: a validation-first EEG report pipeline with provenance-checked explanations"
abstract: >-
  Drop an EEG file, get a validated report. A deterministic pipeline (quality
  control, zero-phase FIR filtering, aperiodic/periodic spectral
  parameterisation, debiased wPLI coupling, rhythmic event detection) whose every
  method is checked against synthetic ground truth and public data, and whose
  narrative explanations are mechanically checked against the computed metrics.
